orname{arctan}⁡{e}^{t}}{\\pi }|}_{-\\infty }^{x} \\\\  & =\\frac{2\\operatorname{arctan}⁡{e}^{x}}{\\pi }\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186419951 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186133727 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "7b0ce833-e045-5aff-94a4-f9ad56cdb904" :knowledge-point/title "Computing a CDF Given a PDF That’s Nonzero Over All Real Numbers"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "095360e1-dd96-5383-931f-a201eff47a39" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "F(x)=1-\\frac{1}{1-{e}^{x}}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186419857} {:answer/id #uuid "170a0edf-da7f-5652-903d-c47b4ac8c342" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "F(x)=1+\\frac{1}{1+{e}^{x}}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186419864} {:answer/id #uuid "3a8d1627-2737-5252-95ce-1a7d32a52868" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "F(x)=1-\\frac{1}{1+{e}^{x}}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186419871} {:answer/id #uuid "4b0ae796-f204-5f28-ae72-68cb7f93938e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "F(x)=1+\\frac{1}{(1+{e}^{x})^{2}}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186419873} {:answer/id #uuid "cfec970b-e672-5e0e-a27f-c56e83e7f7ee" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "F(x)=1-\\frac{1}{(1+{e}^{x})^{2}}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186419918}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "cfec970b-e672-5e0e-a27f-c56e83e7f7ee" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "F(x)=1-\\frac{1}{(1+{e}^{x})^{2}}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186419918} :answer-field/id #uuid "f84d8dbb-e4a3-55af-a310-662430392d90" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186419940}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "ae38bc39-2bd5-58c3-af2b-ad65de482c6d" :question/math-academy-id "q-89635" :question/problem "Given that the random variable $X$ has the probability density function\n\n$$\nf(x)=\\frac{2{e}^{x}}{(1+{e}^{x})^{3}},\\,x\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ),\n$$\n\nfind the cumulative distribution function $F(x).$" :question/worked-solution "The cumulative distribution function of a continuous random variable $X$ is the function $F(x)$ defined by\n\n$$\nF(x)=P(X\\le x)={\\int }_{-\\infty }^{x}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t.\n$$\n\nFor the given probability density function, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}F(x) & ={\\int }_{-\\infty }^{x}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & ={\\int }_{-\\infty }^{x}\\frac{2{e}^{t}}{(1+{e}^{t})^{3}}\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & ={-\\frac{1}{(1+{e}^{t})^{2}}|}_{-\\infty }^{x} \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{(1+{e}^{x})^{2}}+1 \\\\  & =1-\\frac{1}{(1+{e}^{x})^{2}}\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186419952 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186133726 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "1d7509fa-a254-5b78-b307-3e0c4ef4d9ec" :knowledge-point/title "Finding a CDF Given a PDF With a Lower Bound"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "447da342-1533-5f2c-8730-3f4fcfb6eb1b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}-\\frac{3}{2{x}^{5}}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186419872} {:answer/id #uuid "712de365-0023-5929-82ba-68a165ee7cd6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1-\\frac{1}{32{x}^{5}}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186419885} {:answer/id #uuid "8bb2a535-9d88-5742-8c31-810ff3deadc7" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{4{x}^{2}}-\\frac{1}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186419893} {:answer/id #uuid "998775fa-da47-5947-a129-bd6df19698f4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1-\\frac{1}{8{x}^{3}}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186